{"slug":"problems-when-using-manjaro","title":"使用Manjaro系统遇到的一些问题以及解决方案","date":"2021-10-20","tags":["Manjaro"],"category":"Operating System","excerpt":"Problems when using Manjaro","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1,"contentHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p>程序员的意义在于不断折腾<br>\n最近将自己的3台电脑都安装了win11以及Manjaro双系统<br>\n下面谈谈安装以及使用Manjaro时的遇到的一些问题，以及对应的解决方案</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示</strong></p>\n<p>本文涉及所使用的Manjaro版本为<code>21.1.6</code><br>\n桌面使用的是gnome</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"安装chrome\">安装Chrome</h2>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> pacman</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -S</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> --needed</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> base-devel</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> yay</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">yay</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -S</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> google-chrome</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"安装中文输入法fctix5\">安装中文输入法（Fctix5）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>安装依赖</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> pacman</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -S</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> fcitx5</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> fcitx5-chinese-addons</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> fcitx5-qt</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> fcitx5-gtk</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> </span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>创建<code>~/.pam_environment</code>文件</li>\n<li>将如下内容写入<code>~/.pam_environment</code></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">GTK_IM_MODULE</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> DEFAULT=fcitx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">QT_IM_MODULE</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">  DEFAULT=fcitx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">XMODIFIERS</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">    DEFAULT=@im=fcitx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">INPUT_METHOD</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">  DEFAULT=fcitx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">SDL_IM_MODULE</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> DEFAULT=fcitx</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>安装Nord主题（如果需要的话）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">git</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> https://github.com/tonyfettes/fcitx5-nord.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> ~/.local/share/fcitx5/themes/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C5E478;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> fcitx5-nord</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">cp</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> Nord-Dark/</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> Nord-Light/</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> ~/.local/share/fcitx5/themes/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"># ~/.config/fcitx5/conf/classicui.conf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">Theme</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">=</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">Nord-Dark</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"># or</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">Theme</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">=</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">Nord-Light</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>注销重新登录即可</li>\n</ul>\n<p>效果如下：<br>\n<img src=\"./images/fcitx5-nord-theme.png\" alt=\"alt\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>设置开机启动（如果需要的话）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">cp</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> /usr/share/applications/org.fcitx.Fcitx5.desktop</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> ~/.config/autostart/</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"安装vscodevisual-studio-code-bin\">安装VScode（visual-studio-code-bin）</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>注意：警告</strong></p>\n<p>请安装微软官方版本（visual-studio-code-bin）而不是开源版（code），<strong>开源版的问题非常多！</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> pacman</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -S</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> visual-studio-code-bin</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"vscode终端图标乱码问题\">VSCode终端图标乱码问题</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>打开terminal</li>\n<li>在terminal里右键选择配置文件首选项</li>\n<li>将自定义字体那一栏里的字体名称记下</li>\n<li>打开VScode设置，找到Editor Font Size</li>\n<li>将刚刚记下的字体名称放置于最后一个: <code>...其他, \"你的终端字体\"</code>，比如下面是我的配置</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"./images/vscode-font-set.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>附一张完成后vscode的terminal的截图</p>\n<p><img src=\"./images/vscode-terminal.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"安装截图工具flameshot\">安装截图工具（flameshot）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>安装</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> pacman</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -S</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> flameshot</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>设置全局快捷键（如果需要的话）<br>\n设置 <code>=></code> keyboard <code>=></code> Customize Shortcuts <code>=></code> 自定义快捷键 <code>=></code> 点击+ <code>=></code><br>\n命令那一栏填写: <code>flameshot gui</code>，即可使用自定义的快捷键快速启动截图<br>\n下面是我自定义的全局快捷键<code>Ctrl</code> + <code>Alt</code> + <code>A</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"./images/custom-flameshot-shortcut.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"安装录屏工具peek\">安装录屏工具（peek）</h2>\n<p>打开软件管理器，搜索peek安装或者执行<code>sudo pacman -S peek</code></p>\n<p>下面附上一张用peek录制的使用全局快捷键打开flameshot的gif\n<img src=\"./images/peek-flameshot.gif\" alt=\"alt\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"安装qq\">安装QQ</h2>\n<p>我这里使用了<code>icalingua</code>方案</p>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">yay</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -S</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> icalingua</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"安装微信\">安装微信</h2>\n<p>我这里使用的是魔改版<code>wechat-uos</code></p>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">yay</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -S</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> wechat-uos</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"安装钉钉\">安装钉钉</h2>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">yay</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -S</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> dingtalk</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：请安装<code>dingtalk-bin</code>而非<code>dingtalk</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>dingtalk</code>是基于<code>electron</code>开发的web套壳版，功能不全<br>\n而<code>dingtalk-bin</code>为官方linux版，功能较为完善</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>注意：个人体验官方版目前依旧存在一些问题</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>工作台内的应用无法输入中文</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>查找聊天记录功能无法输入中文</li>\n<li>不支持dark mode</li>\n</ul>\n<p>请确保了解后果</p>\n<h2 id=\"安装node环境\">安装node环境</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>安装<code>nvm</code></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -o-</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvm-sh/nvm/v0.39.0/install.sh</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> bash</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>安装<code>node</code></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">nvm</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 14.17.1</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<p>安装完毕后会自动默认使用该版本</p>\n<ul>\n<li>安装<code>yarn</code></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> yarn</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：选择自己的Node版本</strong></p>\n<p>本人使用的node版本为<code>14.17.1</code>，请读者选择自己需要的node版本进行安装</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"结语\">结语</h2>\n<p>因为我在安装使用Manjaro时从事的是前端开发工作，上述的几个步骤完成之后基本可以满足日常开发需求</p>\n<h2 id=\"参考\">参考</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/WeChat_(%E7%AE%80%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87)\">WeChat (简体中文) - ArchWiki</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Fcitx5\">Fcitx5 - ArchWiki</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/dingtalk-bin/\">AUR (en) - dingtalk-bin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/nvm-sh/nvm#installing-and-updating\">nvm-sh/nvm: Node Version Manager - POSIX-compliant bash script to manage multiple active node.js versions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Tencent_QQ_(%E7%AE%80%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87)#Icalingua\">Tencent QQ (简体中文) - ArchWiki</a></li>\n</ul>","related":[{"slug":"old-computer-install-truenas","title":"将闲置电脑改装成 NAS 服务器","date":"2023-12-05","tags":["NAS","Linux"],"category":"Operating System","excerpt":"家里有一台闲置电脑，所性直接改装成 NASA 服务器","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"vue-mixin-usage","title":"Vue2中的mixin使用方式小结","date":"2021-12-23","tags":["Vue"],"category":"Front-end","excerpt":"Vue2中的mixin使用方式小结","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"beautify-windows-terminal","title":"美化windows11的终端","date":"2021-11-01","tags":["Windows"],"category":"Skills","excerpt":"美化windows11的终端","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1}]}